c3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMTk1MTMxMg==", "user": {"login": "Seunghwan17", "id": 37061413, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDYxNDEz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37061413?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17", "html_url": "https://github.com/Seunghwan17", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Seunghwan17/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2018-09-17T09:59:02Z", "updated_at": "2018-09-17T09:59:02Z", "body": "Maybe, I think the SDK could detect base RTK module and send this message(https://mavlink.io/kr/messages/common.html#GPS_RTK) from base to the rover.\r\nRTK module make RTCM3 data. The SDK need to pass a data use mavlink protocol... \r\nBut now I don't know well about RTK and mavlink. I am sorry. \r\nNow I just tested with QGC.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/421951312/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/421981121", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/534#issuecomment-421981121", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/